hadiths[114]{hadithnumber,text}:
"4870","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : zinakar jab zina karta hai to wo momin nahin hota. aur chor jab chori karta hai to wo momin nahin hota. aur jab sharab peeta hai to wo momin nahin hota. aur jab loot maar karta hai jiski taraf log aankhen utha kar dekhtey hon to wo momin nahin hota"
"4871","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ka ye farman manqul hai ke zinakar jab zina karta hai to wo momin nahin hota. aur jab chori karta hai to wo momin nahin hota. aur jab sharab peeta hai to wo momin nahin hota. lekin uskey baad tauba ka darwaza khula hai."
"4872","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke zinakar jab zina karta hai to wo momin nahin hota. aur jab chori karta hai to wo momin nahin hota. aur jab sharab peeta hai to wo momin nahin hota. aur chauthi chiz ka zikr kiya to main bhool gaya. phir jab wo aisa karey to wo Islam ki rassi apni gardan sey utaar phenkta hai. phir agar wo tauba karey to Allah uski tauba qubul farmata hai."
"4873","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : Allah Taala chor par laanat farmaye jo anda chura kar haath katwata hai aur jo rassi chura kar haath katwata hai."
"4874","Hazrat Noman bin Bashir (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke unkey paas Qabila Kalaa key kuchh log muqadma laye ke kapda bananey waley kuchh logon ney hamara saman chura liya hai. unhoney in ko chand din qaid rakha phir unhen chhod diya. wo aaye aur boley : tum ney inhen baghair aazmaish aur maar key chhod diya? Hazrat Noman ney farmaya : jaisa chaho. agar chaho to main inhen maarun. phir agar Allah tumhara saman nikalwa dey to theek, warna main tumhari peethon sey us jaisa lunga. unhoney kaha : kya ye tumhara faisla hai? unhoney farmaya : ye Allah Azza wa Jalla aur uskey Rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ka faisla hai."
"4875","Hazrat Bahaz bin Hakim key dada (Hazrat Muawiya bin Haida Qusheri (Raziallahu anhu)) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney eik aadmi ko kisi ilzam mein qaid kar diya tha."
"4876","Hazrat Bahaz bin Hakim key dada (Hazrat Muawiya bin Haida Qusheri (Raziallahu anhu)) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney eik aadmi ko kisi ilzam mein qaid kar diya tha, phir (ilzam sabit na honey par) usey chhod diya."
"4877","Hazrat Abu Umaiya Makhzoomi (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas eik chor laya gaya jis ney iqrar kiya tha aur uskey paas maal nahin mila tha. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney us sey farmaya : mera khayal nahin ke tum ney chori ki hai? us ney kaha : kyon nahin. aap ney farmaya : usey ley jao aur uska haath kaat do. phir usey laya gaya. aap ney us sey farmaya : kaho : main Allah sey bakhshish mangta hun aur uski taraf rujoo karta hun. us ney kaha : main Allah sey bakhshish mangta hun aur uski taraf rujoo karta hun. aap ney farmaya : aey Allah ! us par reham farma."
"4878","Hazrat Safwan bin Umayya (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke eik aadmi ney un ki chadar chura li. wo usey (chor ko) Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas laye to aap ney uska haath kaatney ka hukm diya. unhoney kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! mainey usey muaf kiya. aap ney farmaya : aey Abu-Wahab ! kya ye us sey pehley nahin ho sakta tha ke tum usey hamarey paas laatey? phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney usey kaat diya."
"4879","Hazrat Safwan bin Umayya sey riwayat hai ke eik aadmi ney (meri) chadar chura li. wo usey Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas laye to aap ney uska haath kaatney ka hukm diya. unhoney kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! mainey usey muaf kar diya. aap ney farmaya : aey Abu-Wahab ! kya ye us sey pehley nahin ho sakta tha ke tum usey merey paas laatey? phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney usey kaat diya."
"4880","Hazrat Ata bin Abu Ribaah sey riwayat hai ke eik aadmi ney kapda chura liya. usey pakad kar Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas laya gaya. aap ney uska haath kaatney ka hukm diya. us aadmi ney kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! wo usi ka hai. aap ney farmaya : kya ye ab sey pehley nahin ho sakta tha?"
"4881","Hazrat Safwan bin Umayya (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke unhoney Baitullah ka tawaf kiya phir namaz padhi phir apni chadar teh kar key apney sar key nichey rakhi aur so gaey. eik chor aaya aur usey unkey sar key nichey sey khinch kar ley gaya. usey pakad kar Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas laya gaya. unhoney farmaya : is ney meri chadar churai hai. Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney us sey farmaya : kya tum ney iski chadar churai hai? us ney kaha : ji han. aap ney farmaya : usey ley jao aur uska haath kaat do. Safwan ney farmaya : main nahin chahta tha ke meri chadar mein uska haath kaata jaey. aap ney us sey farmaya : phir ye us sey pehley kyon na hua? Ash'as bin Sawwar ney mukhalifat ki hai."
"4882","Hazrat ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Hazrat Safwan masjid mein soey huye they jabkey un ki chadar unkey nichey thi. wo chori ho gaee. wo uthey to wo aadmi ja chuka tha. unhoney usey pa liya aur pakad kar Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas laye to aap ney uska haath kaatney ka hukm diya. Safwan ney kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! meri chadar itni (qeemti) to nahin thi ke us mein kisi aadmi ka haath kaata jaey. aap ney farmaya : kya ye us sey pehley nahin ho sakta tha ke tum usey merey paas laatey Abu-Abdur-Rehman ney farmaya : Ash'as zaeef hai."
"4883","Hazrat Safwan bin Umayya sey riwayat hai ke main masjid mein apni tees dirham ki qeemti khameesa (chadar) par soya hua tha. eik aadmi aaya aur usey mujh sey uchak ley gaya. wo aadmi pakda gaya aur Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas laya gaya. aap ney usey kaatney ka hukm diya. main aap key paas aaya aur arz ki : kya tum tees dirham ki khatir usey kaat-tey ho? main usey bechta hun aur uski qeemat udhaar rakhta hun. unhoney farmaya : kya ye us sey pehley nahin ho sakta tha ke tum usey merey paas laatey"
"4884","Hazrat Safwan bin Umayya sey riwayat hai ke unki khameesa unkey sar key nichey sey chori ho gaee jabkey wo Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ki masjid mein soey huye they. unhoney chor ko pakad kar Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas laya to aap ney usey kaatney ka hukm diya. Safwan ney kaha : kya tum usey kaat-tey ho? aap ney farmaya : kya ye us sey pehley nahin ho sakta tha ke tum usey merey paas laatey"
"4885","Hazrat Amr bin Shuaib apney baap sey, wo apney dada sey, wo Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sey riwayat kartey hain ke aap ney farmaya : hudud ko merey paas laney sey pehley aapas mein muaf kar diya karo. phir jo hadd merey paas aa gaee wo wajib ho gaee."
"4886","Hazrat Amr bin Shuaib apney baap sey, Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr sey riwayat kartey hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : hudud ko aapas mein muaf kar diya karo. phir jo hadd mujh tak pahunch gaee wo wajib ho gaee."
"4887","Hazrat ibne-Umar Raziallahu anhuma sey riwayat hai ke eik Makhzoomi aurat logon sey gharelu saman istemal key liye liya karti thi, phir wapis karney sey mukar jati thi. Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney uska haath kaatney ka hukm diya."
"4888","Hazrat ibne-Umar Raziallahu anhuma sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : eik Makhzoomi aurat apni padosanon ki maarfat cheezen udhaar liya karti thi aur phir wapis karney sey mukar jati thi. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney uska haath kaatney ka hukm diya."
"4889","Hazrat ibne-Umar Raziallahu anhuma sey riwayat hai ke eik aurat logon key zewraat mang kar ley jaya karti thi aur phir wapis karney sey ruk jati thi. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : ye aurat Allah aur uskey Rasool sey tauba karey aur jo kuchh us ney logon sey liya hai wo wapis karey. phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya (uskey baad) Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : aey Bilal ! khadey ho, uska haath pakdo aur kaat do."
"4890","Hazrat Naafey (Rahmatullahi Alaih) sey riwayat hai ke eik aurat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key zamaney mein zewraat mang kar ley jaya karti thi. us ney zewraat liye, jama kiye phir wapis karney sey ruk gaee. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : ye aurat tauba karey aur jo uskey paas hai wo ada karey. kayi baar (farmaya) magar us ney na kiya. phir aap ney hukm diya to us (ka haath) kaat diya gaya."
"4891","Hazrat Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke banu Makhzoom ki eik aurat ney chori kar li. usey Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas laya gaya. us ney Ummey Salma ki panah li. Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : agar Fatima bint-e-Muhammad hotin to main uska haath kaat deta. phir uska haath kaat diya gaya."
"4892","Hazrat Saeed bin Musaiyab sey marwi hai ke banu Makhzoom ki eik aurat ney dusrey logon key wastey sey zewar istemal key liye liya, phir (wapis karney sey) mukar gaee. Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney uskey barey mein hukm diya to us (ka haath) kaat diya gaya."
"4893","Hazrat Saeed bin Musaiyab ney aisi hi hadees bayan ki."
"4894","Hazrat Sufiyan sey riwayat hai ke eik Makhzoomi aurat saman udhaar liya karti thi aur mukar jati thi. usey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas laya gaya aur uskey barey mein guftagu ki gaee. aap ney farmaya : agar Fatima hotin to main uska haath kaat deta. Sufiyan sey puchha gaya ke ye kis ney bayan kiya? unhoney kaha : Ayyub bin Musa ney Zohri sey, unhoney Urwa sey, unhoney Aaisha sey, agar Allah ney chaha."
"4895","Hazrat Urwa Hazrat Aaisha sey riwayat kartey hain ke eik aurat ney chori ki to usey Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas laya gaya. logon ney kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sey kon jur'at kar sakta hai siwa Usama key? logon ney Usama sey kaha to unhoney aap sey guftagu ki. Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : aey Usama ! Bani-Israel isi liye halak huin ke jab un mein shareef chori karta to usey chhod dete aur jab kamzor pahunchta to us par qaim karte. agar Fatima bint-e-Muhammad hotin to main unhen kaat deta."
"4896","Hazrat Urwa Hazrat Aaisha sey riwayat kartey hain ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas eik chor laya gaya to aap ney usey kaat diya. logon ney kaha : hamara khayal nahin tha ke baat yahan tak pahuncheygi. aap ney farmaya : agar Fatima hotin to main unhen kaat deta."
"4897","Hazrat Urwa Hazrat Aaisha sey riwayat kartey hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key daur mein eik aurat ney chori ki. logon ney kaha : hum uskey barey mein us sey guftagu nahin karengey. us sey guftagu karney wala uska chahita Usama key siwa koi nahin. unhoney us sey guftagu ki to unhoney farmaya : aey Usama ! Bani-Israel aisi hi baat sey halak huin. jab un mein shareef chori karta to usey chhod dete aur jab kamzor chori karta aur jab kamzor chori karta to usey kaattey. aur wo agar Fatima bint-e-Muhammad hotin to main unhen kaat deta."
"4898","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai ke eik aurat ney dusrey logon ki maarfat kuchh zewraat aarzi taur par liye jinkey naam malum they jabkey uska naam malum nahin tha. phir us ney unhen bech diya aur qeemat rakh li. usey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas laya gaya. uskey ghar waley Usama bin Zaid key paas gaey. unhoney Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sey uskey barey mein guftagu ki to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ka chehra mutaghayyar ho gaya phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) us shaam khadey huye, Allah ki uski shan key mutabiq hamd-o-sana ki, phir farmaya : amma baad, tum sey pehley log isi liye halak huye ke jab un mein shareef chori karta to usey chhod dete aur jab kamzor chori karta to us par hadd qaim karte. qism us zaat ki jiskey haath mein Muhammad ki jaan hai ! agar Fatima bint-e-Muhammad chori kartin to main unka haath kaat deta. phir unhoney us aurat ka (haath kaat diya)."
"4899","Hazrat Urwa Hazrat Aaisha sey riwayat kartey hain ke Quraish ko banu Makhzoom ki eik aurat key mamley ney pareshan kar diya jis ney chori ki thi. unhoney kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sey uskey barey mein kon guftagu karega? unhoney kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key chahitey Usama bin Zaid key siwa kon jur'at karega? Usama ney aap sey guftagu ki to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : kya tum Allah ki hudud mein sey eik hadd key barey mein sifarish kartey ho? phir aap khadey huye phir aap khadey huye aur khutba diya. aap ney farmaya : tum sey pehley log isi liye halak huye ke jab un mein shareef chori karta to usey chhod dete aur jab kamzor chori karta to us par hadd qaim karte. Allah ki qism ! agar Fatima bint-e-Muhammad chori kartin to main unka haath kaat deta."
"4900","Hazrat Urwa Hazrat Aaisha sey riwayat kartey hain ke Quraish key eik qabiley banu Makhzoom ki eik aurat ney chori ki. usey Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas laya gaya. logon ney kaha : uskey barey mein us sey kon guftagu karega? unhoney kaha : Usama bin Zaid. wo aap key paas aaye aur aap sey guftagu ki to aap ney unhen jhidka aur farmaya : tum sey pehley Bani-Israel isi liye halak huin ke jab un mein shareef chori karta to usey chhod dete. aur jab kamzor chori karta to usey kaattey. qism us zaat ki jiskey haath mein meri jaan hai ! agar Fatima bint-e-Muhammad chori kartin to main unhen kaat deta."
"4901","Hazrat Urwa Hazrat Aaisha sey riwayat kartey hain ke Quraish ko banu Makhzoom ki eik aurat key mamley ney pareshan kar diya jis ney chori ki thi. unhoney kaha : uskey barey mein kon guftagu karega? unhoney kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key chahitey Usama bin Zaid key siwa kon jur'at karega? Usama ney aap sey guftagu ki to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : tum sey pehley log isi liye halak huye ke jab un mein shareef chori karta to usey chhod dete. aur jab kamzor chori karta to us par hadd qaim karte. aur Allah ki qism ! agar Fatima bint-e-Muhammad chori kartin to main unka haath kaat deta."
"4902","Hazrat Urwa bin Zuber Hazrat Aaisha sey riwayat kartey hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key daur mein Fath key ghazwey mein eik aurat ney chori ki. usey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas laya gaya. Usama bin Zaid ney aap sey uskey barey mein guftagu ki. phir jab unhoney aap sey guftagu ki to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ka chehra mutaghayyar ho gaya. phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya to Usama ney un sey kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! merey liye bakhshish ki dua farmayen. phir jab shaam hui to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) khadey huye aur Allah ki uski shan key mutabiq hamd-o-sana ki. phir farmaya : amma baad, tum sey pehley log isi liye halak huye ke jab un mein shareef chori karta to usey chhod dete aur jab kamzor chori karta to us par hadd qaim karte. phir farmaya : qism us zaat ki jiskey haath mein meri jaan hai ! agar Fatima bint-e-Muhammad chori kartin to main unka haath kaat deta."
"4903","Hazrat Zohri sey riwayat hai ke mujhey Urwa bin Zuber ney bataya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key daur mein Fath key ghazwey mein mursal taur par eik aurat ney chori ki. uski qom Usama bin Zaid key paas sifarish key liye ghabra kar aai. Urwa ney farmaya : phir jab Usama ney aap sey uskey barey mein guftagu ki to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ka chehra mutaghayyar ho gaya. aap ney farmaya : kya tum mujh sey Allah ki hudud mein sey eik hadd key barey mein guftagu kartey ho? Usama ney kaha : (aey Allah key Rasool) merey liye bakhshish ki dua farmaain phir jab shaam hui to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) khateeb ki haisiyat sey khadey huye aur Allah ki uski shan key mutabiq hamd ki. phir farmaya : amma baad, tum sey pehley log isi liye halak huye ke jab un mein shareef chori karta to usey chhod dete aur jab kamzor chori karta to us par hadd qaim karte. qism us zaat ki jiskey haath mein Muhammad ki jaan hai ! agar Fatima bint-e-Muhammad chori kartin to main unka haath kaat deta. phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney us aurat key haath ka hukm diya to wo kaat diya gaya. uskey baad uski tauba achchhi ho gaee. Hazrat Aaisha ney farmaya : wo uskey baad merey paas aati thin to main uski hajat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) tak pahunchati thi."
"4904","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : zamin mein eik hadd nafiz kar dena zamin par basney walon key liye tees subah ki barish sey behtar hai."
"4905","Hazrat Abu-Zura sey riwayat hai ke Hazrat Abu-Hurera ney farmaya : kisi zamin mein hadd qaim karna uskey rehne walon key liye chaalis raaton ki barish sey behtar hai."
"4906","Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney eik dhaal ki chori par haath kaataa jiski qeemat paanch dirham thi. aisa hi kaha."
"4907","Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney eik dhaal ki chori par haath kaataa jiski qeemat teen dirham thi. Abu Abdur-Rehman (Imam Nasai) ney farmaya : yehi durust hai."
"4908","Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney eik dhaal ki chori par haath kaataa jiski qeemat teen dirham thi."
"4909","Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ney bataya ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney eik chor ka haath kaataa jis ney aurton key dalaan mein sey eik dhaal churayi thi jiski qeemat teen dirham thi."
"4910","Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney teen dirham ki qeemat ki dhaal ki chori par (haath) kaataa."
"4911","Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney dhaal (ki chori) par (haath) kaataa. Abu Abdur-Rehman (Imam Nasai) ney farmaya : ye khata hai."
"4912","Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Hazrat Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ney paanch dirham ki qeemat ki dhaal (ki chori) par (haath) kaataa. yehi durust hai."
"4913","Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Hazrat Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) key daur mein eik shakhs ney dhaal churayi jiski qeemat paanch dirham lagaai gaee. phir (uska haath) kaat diya gaya."
"4914","Ummul-Mominin Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney chothai deenar (ki chori) par (haath) kaataa."
"4915","Hazrat Urwa Hazrat Aaisha sey riwayat kartey hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : (chor ka) haath dhaal ki qeemat key baghair nahin kaataa jaeyga, teesrey deenar ya aadhey deenar ya is sey ziyada mein."
"4916","Hazrat Zohri Hazrat Amra sey, wo Hazrat Aaisha Raziallahu anhuma sey, wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sey riwayat kartey hain ke chor ka haath chothai deenar mein kaataa jaeyga."
"4917","Hazrat Urwa aur Amra Hazrat Aaisha sey riwayat kartey hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : chor ka haath chothai deenar ya is sey ziyada mein kaataa jaeyga."
"4918","Hazrat Amra Hazrat Aaisha sey, wo Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sey riwayat karti hain ke aap ney farmaya : chor ka haath chothai deenar ya is sey ziyada mein kaataa jaeyga."
"4919","Hazrat Amra Hazrat Aaisha sey, wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sey riwayat karti hain ke aap ney farmaya : chor ka haath chothai deenar ya is sey ziyada mein kaataa jaeyga."
"4920","Hazrat Amra Hazrat Aaisha sey riwayat karti hain ke chor ka haath chothai deenar ya is sey ziyada mein kaataa jaeyga."
"4921","Hazrat Amra Hazrat Aaisha sey riwayat karti hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) chothai deenar ya is sey ziyada mein (haath) kaattey they. Qutaiba ney kaha : Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) chothai deenar ya is sey ziyada mein kaattey they."
"4922","Hazrat Amra Hazrat Aaisha sey, wo Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sey riwayat karti hain ke chor ka haath chothai deenar ya is sey ziyada mein kaataa jaeyga."
"4923","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : chor ka haath chothai deenar ya is sey ziyada mein kaataa jaeyga."
"4924","Hazrat Amra sey riwayat hai ke unhoney Hazrat Aaisha ko farmatey suna : chothai deenar ya is sey ziyada mein (haath) kaataa jaeyga. Abu Abdur-Rehman (Imam Nasai) ney farmaya : Yahya ki hadees ka yehi durust nuskha hai."
"4925","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai ke (haath) kaatney ka hukm chothai deenar ya us sey ziyada ki chori mein laagu hota hai."
"4926","Hazrat Qutaiba, Sufiyan sey, wo Yahya bin Saeed sey aur Abd-e-Rabbihi sey aur Ruzaiq Aila waley sey riwayat kartey hain ke unhoney Amra ko Hazrat Aaisha sey riwayat kartey suna : (haath) kaatney ka hukm chothai deenar ya us sey ziyada ki chori mein nafiz hoga."
"4927","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ney farmaya : ziyada arsa nahin guzra aur na main bhooli hun ke haath kaatney ka hukm chothai deenar ya us sey ziyada ki chori mein hai."
"4928","Hazrat Amra Hazrat Aaisha sey riwayat karti hain ke unhoney Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ko farmatey suna : chor ka haath chothai deenar ya us sey ziyada key baghair nahin kaataa jaeyga."
"4929","Hazrat Amra Hazrat Aaisha sey, wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sey awwal (mazkur) ki manind riwayat karti hain."
"4930","Hazrat Amra sey riwayat hai ke Hazrat Aaisha ney farmaya : (haath) kaatney ka hukm chothai deenar ya us sey ziyada ki chori mein hai."
"4931","Ummul-Mominin Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : chor ka haath dhaal ki qeemat mein kaataa jaeyga. aur dhaal ki qeemat chothai deenar hai."
"4932","Ummul-Mominin Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) chothai deenar ya is sey ziyada mein haath kaattey they."
"4933","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : (chor ka) haath chothai deenar key baghair nahin kaataa jaeyga."
"4934","Hazrat Usman bin Abi Al-Walid sey riwayat hai ke mainey Urwa bin Zuber ko farmatey suna : Hazrat Aaisha Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sey bayan karti thin ke aap ney farmaya : chor ka haath dhaal ya uski qeemat key baghair nahin kaataa jaeyga. aur unhoney farmaya ke Urwa ney kaha : dhaal chaar dirham ki thi. aur Sulaiman bin Yasar sey riwayat hai ke mainey Hazrat Umar (Raziallahu anhu) sey suna aur Sulaiman bin Yasar sey riwayat hai ke unhoney Hazrat Amra sey suna, unhoney kaha : mainey Hazrat Aaisha sey suna, unhoney kaha : mainey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sey suna, aap ney farmaya : chor ka haath chaar deenar ya is sey ziyada key baghair nahin kaataa jaeyga."
"4935","Hazrat Sulaiman bin Yasar sey riwayat hai ke unhoney Hazrat Amra bint-e-Abdur-Rehman sey suna, unhoney Hazrat Aaisha sey suna, unhoney Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sey suna, aap ney farmaya : chor ka haath dhaal sey kam mein nahin kaataa jaeyga. Hazrat Aaisha sey puchha gaya : dhaal ki qeemat kya hai? unhoney farmaya unhoney farmaya : chaar (paon wala) deenar ka chauthaai."
"4936","Hazrat Sulaiman bin Yasar Hazrat Amra sey, wo Hazrat Aaisha sey riwayat kartey hain ke unhoney Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ko farmatey suna : chor ka haath chothai deenar ya us sey ziyada key baghair nahin kaataa jaeyga."
"4937","Hazrat Makhrama apney baap sey riwayat kartey hain ke mainey Usman bin Abi Al-Walid jo Akhnasiyon key azaad kardah ghulam hain, sey suna, wo Urwa bin Zuber sey suntey they, wo farmatey they : Hazrat Aaisha Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sey bayan karti thin, aap farmatey they : (chor ka) haath dhaal ya uski qeemat key baghair nahin kaataa jaeyga."
"4938","Hazrat Usman bin Abi Al-Walid sey riwayat hai ke mainey Urwa bin Zuber ko farmatey suna : Hazrat Aaisha Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sey bayan karti thin ke aap ney farmaya : (chor ka) haath dhaal ya uski qeemat key baghair nahin kaataa jaeyga. aur unhoney gumaan kiya ke Urwa ney kaha : dhaal chaar dirham ki thi."
"4940","Hazrat Sulaiman bin Yasar ka gumaan hai ke unhoney Hazrat Amra sey suna, wo farmati thin ke mainey Hazrat Aaisha ko bayan kartey suna ke unhoney Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ko farmatey suna : (chor ka) haath chothai deenar sey kam mein nahin kaataa jaeyga."
"4941","Hazrat Hisham apney baap sey, wo Hazrat Aaisha sey riwayat kartey hain ke chor ka haath chhoti dhaal ya sipar sey kam mein nahin kaataa gaya aur un mein sey har eik qeemti thi."
"4942","Hazrat Sha'bi Hazrat Abdullah sey riwayat kartey hain ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney paanch dirham ki qeemat mein (haath) kaataa."
"4943","Hazrat Aiman sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney chor ka haath dhaal ki qeemat key baghair nahin kaataa. aur dhaal ki qeemat un dino eik deenar thi."
"4944","Hazrat Aiman sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key zamanae-mubarak mein haath dhaal ki qeemat key baghair nahin kaataa jata tha. aur us din uski qeemat eik deenar thi."
"4945","Hazrat Aiman sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key zamanae-mubarak mein haath dhaal ki qeemat key baghair nahin kaataa jata tha. aur dhaal ki qeemat us din eik deenar thi."
"4946","Hazrat Aiman sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key ahad mein haath dhaal ki qeemat key baghair nahin kaataa jata tha. aur uski qeemat us din eik deenar thi."
"4947","Hazrat Aiman sey riwayat hai ke chor ka haath dhaal ki qeemat mein kaataa jaeyga. aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key ahad mein dhaal ki qeemat eik deenar ya das dirham thi."
"4948","Hazrat Aiman bin Ummey Aiman marfooan (Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sey) riwayat kartey hain ke (chor ka) haath dhaal ki qeemat key baghair nahin kaataa jaeyga. aur uski qeemat us din eik deenar thi."
"4949","Hazrat Aiman sey riwayat hai ke chor dhaal ki qeemat sey kam mein nahin kaataa jaeyga."
"4950","Hazrat Ata bin Abu Ribaah sey riwayat hai ke Hazrat Abdullah bin Abbas farmatey they ke us din uski qeemat das dirham thi."
"4951","Hazrat ibne-Abbas sey aisi hi riwayat manqul hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key daur mein dhaal ki qeemat das dirham lagaai jati thi."
"4952","Hazrat Ayyub bin Musa sey, wo Ata sey mursal taur par aisi hi riwayat bayan kartey hain."
"4953","Hazrat Ata sey riwayat hai ke kam sey kam miqdaar jiski chori mein haath kaataa jata hai, dhaal ki qeemat hai. aur dhaal ki qeemat un dino das dirham thi. Abu Abdur-Rehman (Imam Nasai) ney farmaya : aur Aiman jinki hadees ka ham ney pehley zikr kiya hai, mera khayal nahin ke unhen sahabiyat hasil ho. aur un sey dusri hadees bhi marwi hai jo hamarey qaul par dalalat karti hai."
"4954","Hazrat Ata ney Hazrat Aiman Mola ibne Zuber ya Mola Zuber sey bayan kiya, wo riwayat kartey hain Hazrat Tabia sey aur wo bayan kartey hain Hazrat Kaab sey, unhoney farmaya : jo shakhs wuzu karey aur achchhi tarah wuzu kerey, phir namaz padhey. aur Abdur-Rehman ney kaha : phir Isha ki namaz jamaat sey padhey, phir uskey baad usi jaisi chaar rakaten padhey, un mein qiraat karey aur ruku-sujud pura karey to uskey liye shab-e-qadr jaisa ajr hoga."
"4955","Hazrat Ata ney Aiman Mola ibne Umar sey, wo Tabia sey, wo Kaab sey riwayat kartey hain, unhoney farmaya : jo shakhs wuzu karey aur achchhi tarah wuzu kerey, phir Isha ki namaz jamaat sey padhey, phir uskey baad usi jaisi chaar rakaten padhey, un mein qiraat karey aur ruku-sujud pura karey to uskey liye shab-e-qadr jaisa ajr hoga."
"4956","Hazrat Amr bin Shuaib apney baap sey, wo apney dada sey riwayat kartey hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key daur mein dhaal ki qeemat das dirham thi."
"4957","Hazrat Amr bin Shuaib key pardada (Abdullah bin Amr Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sey puchha gaya ke haath kitney (maal) mein kaataa jaeyga? aap ney farmaya : darkht par lagey huye phal todney sey haath nahin kaataa jaeyga, albatta jab phal tod kar dher laga diya gaya ho to dhaal ki qeemat key barabar chori karney sey haath kaataa jaeyga. aur pahad mein charney waley janwar ki chori mein haath nahin kaataa jaeyga. phir jab wo baadey mein aa jaey to dhaal ki qeemat key barabar chori karney sey haath kaataa jaeyga."
"4958","Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr Raziallahu anhuma sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sey darkht par lagey huye phal key barey mein puchha gaya to aap ney farmaya : agar to koi hajat-mand phal tod kar kha ley, sath na ley jaey to usey kuchh nahin kaha jaeyga. aur agar koi sath ley kar nikley to us par dugna jurmana aur saza hogi. aur jo darkht sey todney key baad dher mein sey chori karey aur wo dhaal ki qeemat ko pahunch jaey to us par (haath kaatney ka) hukm laagu hoga aur jo is sey kam chori karey to us par dugna jurmana aur saza hogi."
"4959","Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr Raziallahu anhuma sey riwayat hai ke Muzena qabiley ka eik aadmi Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas aaya aur kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! pahad mein charney waley janwar key barey mein kya khayal hai? aap ney farmaya : wo aur us jaisa (jurmana) aur sazaa. aur charney waley maweshiyon mein sey kisi chiz mein haath nahin kaataa jaeyga magar jisey baadey mein laaya gaya ho aur wo (dhaal ki qeemat ko) pahunch jaey us ney kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! darkht par lagey huye phal key barey mein kya khayal hai? aap ney farmaya : wo aur us jaisa uskey sath aur saza. aur darkht par lagey huye phal mein sey kisi chiz mein (haath kaatney ka) hukm nahin siwa uskey jama kiya gaya ho. dher mein sey jo liya gaya aur wo dhaal ki qeemat ko pahunch jaey to us mein (haath kaatney ka) hukm hai. aur jo dhaal ki qeemat ko na pahunchey to us mein dugna jurmana aur ib-rat key kodey hain."
"4960","Hazrat Raafey bin Khadij (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : mainey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ko farmatey suna : phal aur gaabhey (goodey) mein haath nahin kaataa jaeyga."
"4961","Hazrat Raafey bin Khadij (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : mainey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ko farmatey suna : phal aur gaabhey (goodey) mein haath nahin kaataa jaeyga."
"4962","Hazrat Raafey bin Khadij (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : mainey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ko farmatey suna : phal aur gaabhey (goodey) mein haath nahin kaataa jaeyga."
"4963","Hazrat Raafey bin Khadij (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : phal aur gaabhey (goodey) mein haath nahin kaataa jaeyga."
"4964","Hazrat Raafey bin Khadij Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sey riwayat kartey hain ke aap ney farmaya : phal aur gaabhey (goodey) mein haath nahin kaataa jaeyga."
"4965","Hazrat Raafey bin Khadij (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : phal aur gaabhey (goodey) mein haath nahin kaataa jaeyga."
"4966","Hazrat Raafey bin Khadij sey, wo apney chacha Wasi sey, wo Raafey bin Khadij sey riwayat kartey hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : phal aur gaabhey (goodey) mein haath nahin kaataa jaeyga."
"4967","Hazrat Raafey bin Khadij (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : mainey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ko farmatey suna : phal aur gaabhey (goodey) mein haath nahin kaataa jaeyga. aur gaabhaa khajoor key maghz (goodey) ko kehtey hain."
"4968","Hazrat Raafey bin Khadij sey, wo Abu-Maimun sey, wo Raafey bin Khadij sey riwayat kartey hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : phal aur gaabhey (goodey) mein haath nahin kaataa jaeyga. Abu Abdur-Rehman (Imam Nasai) ney farmaya : ye khata hai. Abu-Maimun ko main nahin janta."
"4969","Hazrat Raafey bin Khadij sey, wo apni qom key eik aadmi sey, wo Raafey bin Khadij sey riwayat kartey hain ke mainey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ko farmatey suna : phal aur gaabhey (goodey) mein haath nahin kaataa jaeyga."
"4970","Hazrat Raafey bin Khadij sey, wo apney chacha key eik aadmi sey riwayat kartey hain ke Raafey bin Khadij ney farmaya : mainey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ko farmatey suna : phal aur gaabhey (goodey) mein haath nahin kaataa jaeyga."
"4971","Hazrat Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : khayanat karney waley, lootney waley aur jhapat kar chhin leney waley ka haath nahin kaataa jaeyga. Sufiyan ney Abu-Zuber sey nahin suna."
"4972","Hazrat Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : khayanat karney waley ka haath nahin kaataa jaeyga. Abu Abdur-Rehman (Imam Nasai) ney farmaya : ibne-Juraij ney bhi Abu-Zuber sey nahin suna."
"4973","Hazrat Jabir sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jhapat maar kar chhin ley janey waley ka haath nahin kaataa jaeyga."
"4974","Hazrat Jabir sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : khayanat karney waley ka haath nahin kaataa jaeyga. Abu Abdur-Rehman (Imam Nasai) ney farmaya : ye hadees ibne-Juraij sey Isa bin Yunus, Fazal bin Musa, ibne-Wahab, Muhammad bin Rabeea, Makhlad bin Yazeed aur Salma bin Saeed Basri siqa ney riwayat ki hai. ibne-Abi Safwan ney kaha : aur wo apney zamaney key behtareen logon mein sey they. un mein sey kisi ney nahin kaha : mujhey Abu-Zuber ney bayan kiya aur un mein sey kisi ney nahin kaha : mujhey Abu-Zuber ney bayan kiya. aur main nahin samajhta ke us ney usey Abu-Zuber sey suna hai. Allah behtar janta hai."
"4975","Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas eik chor laya gaya. aap ney farmaya : usey qatl kar do. logon ney kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! us ney to sirf chori ki hai. aap ney farmaya : uska haath kaat do. phir uska haath kaat diya gaya"
"4976","Hazrat Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke khayanat karney waley ka haath nahin kaataa jaeyga. Abu Abdur-Rehman (Imam Nasai) ney farmaya : Ash'as bin Sawwar zaeef hai."
"4977","Hazrat Haris bin Haatib (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas eik chor laya gaya. aap ney farmaya : isey qatl kar do. logon ney kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! us ney to sirf chori ki hai. aap ney farmaya : isey qatl kar do. logon ney kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! us ney to sirf chori ki hai. aap ney farmaya : uska haath kaat do. unhoney farmaya : phir us ney chori ki to uska paon kaat diya gaya. phir us ney Hazrat Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) key daur mein chori ki phir Hazrat Abu-Bakar ney farmaya : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) uskey barey mein ziyada behtar jantey they jab aap ney farmaya : usey qatl kar do. phir unhoney usey Quraish key chand nojawano key hawale kar diya taake usey qatl karen. un mein sey Abdullah bin Zuber bhi they jo imaarat ko pasand kartey they. unhoney kaha : mujhey apna ameer bana lo. unhoney unhen apna ameer bana liya. phir jab wo waar kartey to wo waar kartey yahan tak ke usey qatl kar diya."
"4978","Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas eik chor laya gaya. aap ney farmaya : usey qatl kar do. logon ney kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! us ney to sirf chori ki hai. aap ney farmaya : usey qatl kar do. logon ney kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! us ney to sirf chori ki hai. aap ney farmaya : uska haath kaat do. phir uska haath kaat diya gaya. phir usey dusri baar laya gaya. aap ney farmaya : usey qatl kar do. logon ney kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! us ney to sirf chori ki hai. aap ney farmaya : uska haath kaat do. phir uska haath kaat diya gaya. phir usey phir teesri baar laya gaya. aap ney farmaya : usey qatl kar do. unhoney kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! us ney to sirf chori ki hai. aap ney farmaya : usey kaat do. phir chauthi baar laya gaya. aap ney farmaya : usey qatl kar do. unhoney kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! us ney to sirf chori ki hai. aap ney farmaya : usey kaat do. phir paanchwin baar laya gaya. aap ney farmaya : usey qatl kar do. Jabir ney kaha : hum usey maweshiyon key baadey mein ley gaey aur usey uthaya, wo peeth key bal lait gaya, phir us ney apney haath-paon phela diye to oont bhag gaey. phir unhoney dusri baar us par hamla kiya to us ney aisa hi kiya. phir teesri baar hamla kiya to hum ney usey pathar maarey aur qatl kar diya. phir hum ney usey kunwen mein phenka aur us par pathar daal diye. Abu-Abdur-Rehman ney farmaya : ye hadees munkar hai. aur Mus'ab bin Saabit hadees mein qawi nahin. Allah behtar janta hai."
"4979","Hazrat Junaada bin Abi Umayya sey riwayat hai ke mainey Basar bin Abi Artaat sey suna, unhoney farmaya ke mainey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ko farmatey suna : safar mein haath nahin kaatey jaengey."
"4980","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ka ye farman manqul hai ke jab ghulam chori karey to usey bech do chahey rassi key iwaz hi. Abu Abdur-Rehman (Imam Nasai) ney farmaya : Umar bin Abi Salma hadees mein qawi nahin."
"4981","Hazrat Atiya sey riwayat hai ke wo Qureza key qaidiyon mein they. dekha jata tha ke jis qaidi key zere-naaf baal nikal aaye hon usey qatl kar diya jata aur jiskey na nikley hon usey zinda chhod diya jata aur qatl nahin kiya jata tha."
"4982","Hazrat ibne-Muheriz sey riwayat hai ke mainey Hazrat Fazala bin Ubaid (Raziallahu anhu) sey chor ka haath uski gardan mein latkaney key barey mein puchha. unhoney farmaya : sunnat hai. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney eik chor ka haath kaataa aur uska haath uski gardan mein latka diya."
"4983","Hazrat Abdur-Rehman bin Muhaireez bayan kartey hain ke mainey Hazrat Fazala bin Ubaid (Raziallahu anhu) sey puchha : farmaain kya chor ka haath uski gardan mein latkana sunnat hai? unhoney farmaya : ji han. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas eik chor laya gaya. aap ney uska haath kaataa aur usey uski gardan mein latka diya. Abu Abdur-Rehman (Imam Nasai) ney farmaya : Hajjaj bin Artaat zaeef hai aur uski hadees hujjat nahin."
"4984","Hazrat Abdur-Rehman bin Auf (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jab chor par hadd nafiz (laagu) kar di jaey to us par (maal ka) tawan nahin."
